(7261443, 1128632, 60173, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL, you got a ticket. ;-) Beautiful image, wrong challenge. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It absolutely fit the challenge for me, because this is exactly what the first day of school always looked like outside where I''m from. It was chilly, foggy as heck, and the smell of hops dominated the senses. My early years were spent living at the end of endless dirt roads just like this one. <br/> <br/>So, perfect fit for the challenge for me. You have my blessing to rip up that "ticket" City-boy Art gave you.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: LOL, you got a ticket. ;-) Beautiful image, wrong challenge. :)   It absolutely fit the challenge for me, because this is exactly what the first day of school always looked like outside where I''m from. It was chilly, foggy as heck, and the smell of hops dominated the senses. My early years were spent living at the end of endless dirt roads just like this one.  So, perfect fit for the challenge for me. You have my blessing to rip up that "ticket" City-boy Art gave you.', '2014-09-09 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
